<tr><td>150–160 King St, SF</td><td>Warehouse</td><td>Sep 27, 1999</td></tr>
<tr><td>33201 Dowe Ave, Union City</td><td>Distribution center, 143,232 sq ft</td><td>Sublease, Jul 1, 1999</td></tr>
